<h2>Before you begin</h2><p>These guides are available to everyone. To open the tools, sign in with an account that has an eligible trial, subscription, or complimentary access. Choose a tool from your <a href="<?= site_url('dashboard') ?>">dashboard</a>.</p>
<p>For a typical print job, prepare individual images in Image Studio, export them, then upload those files to Gang Sheet Builder. You can also add a downloaded QR code to your artwork.</p>
